{
    "background_story": "Zen was a charismatic and cunning businessman who built his empire through ruthless tactics and cravenness. He had no qualms about stepping on others to get ahead, often using manipulation and deceit to eliminate his competitors. His willingness to do whatever it took to succeed earned him many enemies, but also brought him immense wealth and power. However, his craven nature eventually caught up with him. When a former partner threatened to expose his shady dealings, Zen resorted to desperate measures, including bribery and intimidation. But the partner had already gone to the authorities, and Zen's empire came crashing down. His legacy was one of greed and corruption, a cautionary tale of the dangers of unchecked ambition and cravenness.",
